    "use_links": "false",
    "display_name": "Jonah’s Cafeteria App",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Jonah’s school dropped the only lunches he could eat, and the menu app thinks he wants things he can't eat. Find out who the menu was built for.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/a4425ad5b360a5a2e334da042d849643-data-makes-ai-lesson-10-jonah-a-friendly-chest-up-portrait-of-jonah-in-his-cac-1.png",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "\"I’m vegetarian and the veggie wrap was basically the only thing at school I could eat. Now it’s gone and so is the bean burrito.\"",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e579d84602145f0ff7410e8ea5decb5e-data-makes-ai-lesson-10-jonah-jonah-standing-in-a-school-cafeteria-lunch-line--1.png",
        "key": "data-makes-ai-lesson10-panel-jonah-f0835053-cf13-4b72-87a8-01a69882313d",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"The sign in the cafeteria says the new menu is 'based on what students want.' Nobody asked me. I didn’t even know there was a survey. Now I bring lunch from home every day, which is fine I guess, but my friends all buy lunch so I’m the only one at my table with a lunchbox.\"",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/aaa7e3c5eb662d75a1aaba324012593c-data-makes-ai-lesson-10-jonah-a-crowded-cafeteria-table-jonah-sits-in-the-midd-1.png",
        "key": "data-makes-ai-lesson10-panel-jonah-79da5b50-a1fa-4b92-ae0c-f704e541dfc1",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Also I tried the menu app and it said I would probably buy chicken nuggets lol. I have never eaten a chicken nugget in my life.\"",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/127d560902e8b1de61a8af7b4d6fa4d4-data-makes-ai-lesson-10-jonah-jonah-at-a-desk-or-library-table-holding-up-a-ta-1.png",
        "key": "data-makes-ai-lesson10-panel-jonah-79ec9e18-3370-4e01-8c00-327ee15ee559",
        "typing": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ]
  },
